* ---- macro g1_osc (/work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_osc/layout/g1_osc_lvs.cdl) ----
* LVS reference netlist derived from g1_osc.spice by lvs_netlist.py (see docstring)
.subckt g1_osc en trim[0] trim[1] trim[2] trim[3] osc_clk VDD VSS
RRA VDD va VSS rppd w=1u l=117u b=0 m=1
RRB VDD vb VSS rppd w=1u l=117u b=0 m=1
